<title>UK: Eurofima sets C$100 million 6-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets C$100 million 6-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    C$100 MLN     COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    26.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    26.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA/SW</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SEPTEMBER 2001 CANADA</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
